Topic: Amazon CloudFront — Fast, Secure, and Global Content Delivery

Today’s focus is on Amazon CloudFront, AWS’s Content Delivery Network (CDN) that securely delivers data, videos, applications, and APIs to users across the globe with low latency and high transfer speed.

Whether it’s optimizing website performance, caching static content, or protecting your app from DDoS attacks — CloudFront is a must-know service for every DevOps Engineer.

